sādhūnāṁ hṛdayaṁ tv aham
mad-anyat te na jānanti
nāhaṁ tebhyo manāg api\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"$L29\",\"child-2247\",{\"child\":\"$23:props:children:0:props:children:props:page:child_items:4:children:3\",\"hasId\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"em-mb-4 em-leading-8 em-text-base s-justify\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"“The devotees are always in My heart, and I am always in the hearts of the devotees. The devotee does not know anything beyond Me, and I also cannot forget the devotee. There is a very intimate relationship between Me and the pure devotees. Pure devotees in full knowledge are never out of spiritual touch, and therefore they are very much dear to Me.”\"}}]}]]]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"36:[[\"$\",\"source\",null,{\"srcSet\":\"https://simpleanalyticsbadges.com/vedabase.io?mode=auto\",\"media\":\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"}],[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://simpleanalyticsbadges.com/vedabase.io?mode=auto\",\"loading\":\"lazy\",\"referrerPolicy\":\"no-referrer\",\"crossOrigin\":\"anonymous\"}]]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"footer\",\"className\":\"mt-auto w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-3 mb-6 text-sm text-vb-normal-text/80 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"donors\":\"Shweta Saxena; Gopalakrishnan Soundarajan;    Kuldip Persaud;  Raghava Chandra Dasa; Shubhangi Rajiv Panjiyar; Suparna Kotaru;  Rajendra and Geeta Ramchandani;  Jaykumar Prabhakar; Bharat Vyas; Shri Chander Mohan Gilhotra, HG Prashant Mukund Das, Shri Trilok Singh Grover, HG Bhakta Mitra Das, Laxmi Narayan Agarwal; Ronak Talati; Bhargav Ashok; Akiralali; Rajasa das; Riya and Tejal Chopade; Indradyumna Swami; Jai Devaki Parks;  Ashmi Chakraborty; Hari-kirtana das; Ramesta das; Prasad Buddhavarapu; Kresna Sucandra; Esekiel Jaggernauth\",\"locale\":\"en\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto text-vb-normal-text mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://t.