वासुदेव: सर्वमिति स महात्मा सुदुर्लभ: ॥ १९ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2250,\"bb\":1994,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/19/b1994/\",\"body_value\":\"bahūnāṁ janmanām ante
jñānavān māṁ prapadyate
vāsudevaḥ sarvam iti
sa mahātmā su-durlabhaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":2251,\"bb\":1995,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/19/b1995/\",\"shadow_value\":\"bahūnām – many; janmanām – repeated births and deaths; ante – after; jñāna-vān – one who is in full knowledge; mām – unto Me; prapadyate – surrenders; vāsudevaḥ – the Personality of Godhead, Kṛṣṇa; sarvam – everything; iti – thus; saḥ – that; mahā-ātmā – great soul; su-durlabhaḥ – very rare to see.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"bahūnām\",\"translation\":\"many\"},{\"word\":\"janmanām\",\"translation\":\"repeated births and deaths\"},{\"word\":\"ante\",\"translation\":\"after\"},{\"word\":\"jñāna-vān\",\"translation\":\"one who is in full knowledge\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"unto Me\"},{\"word\":\"prapadyate\",\"translation\":\"surrenders\"},{\"word\":\"vāsudevaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the Personality of Godhead, Kṛṣṇa\"},{\"word\":\"sarvam\",\"translation\":\"everything\"},{\"word\":\"iti\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"mahā-ātmā\",\"translation\":\"great soul\"},{\"word\":\"su-durlabhaḥ\",\"translation\":\"very rare to see\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":2252,\"bb\":1996,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/19/b1996/\",\"body_value\":\"After many births and deaths, he who is actually in knowledge surrenders unto Me, knowing Me to be the cause of all causes and all that is. Such a great soul is very rare.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2253,\"bb\":1997,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/19/b1997/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2254,\"bb\":1998,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/19/b1998/\",\"body_value\":\"This verse is very nicely explained in the Third Chapter (verses 14 and 15) of the Śvetāśvatara Upaniṣad:\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2255,\"bb\":1999,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/19/b1999/\",\"body_value\":\"sahasra-śīrṣā puruṣaḥ
